WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.680
Hey everybody!

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.043
This is Sona.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.470
You know, I thought it would
be a good idea to check in.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.480
And I hope you're all staying safe

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.623
and distancing yourselves
socially from one another.

00:00:16.979 --> 00:00:18.783
I'm having a great time.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.070
Let's see, I got a blow out.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:24.860
Which I realize was probably
a little irresponsible

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.970
but I would've lost 50% of the

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:30.350
payment had I not gone.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:34.210
And in my defense, this
blood is days and days old.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:37.963
I haven't washed my hair
in a really long time.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.790
So I just moved into my house
like a little while ago.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:45.210
My husband and I bought a house

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.240
and I know that on Sona Fixes Your Life

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.700
I once told you guys
that my parents wanted

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.370
to throw all my speech trophies

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.480
because they thought it was

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.473
they were taking up too much space.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.763
'Cause I have too many.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.130
And I thought that they did but then

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:07.450
my mom gave me this, which is basically

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.010
a lot of my childhood is in here.

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:13.003
And I looked at it the other day.

00:01:15.506 --> 00:01:17.523
And look what I found!

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:20.550
All my speech trophies.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:24.220
PSCFA Spring Championship
Senior Duo Interpretation,

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:25.133
second place.

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:28.463
But, that's fine.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.910
You know, and then there's this one.

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:32.743
Third place.

00:01:32.743 --> 00:01:35.007
Okay we'll find one, some good ones.

00:01:35.007 --> 00:01:37.790
And there's this one that's all broken.

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:39.860
That's first place.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:43.790
PSCFA Fall Championship
Senior Speech to Entertain,

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:44.863
first place.

00:01:45.793 --> 00:01:47.550
And then there's all these.

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:49.640
Here's the problem.

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:51.000
And they're all broken.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:51.833
The problem is

00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:54.930
is that when my mom and dad
were holding on to this stuff,

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:57.030
I didn't really care.

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:00.360
But now that it's in my house,

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.073
I don't want them.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.520
So I think that

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:08.243
my mom's idea was I take a
photo shoot with all of these,

00:02:08.243 --> 00:02:12.570
and then just take a picture
to remember all of them.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:13.760
And I

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:17.454
I think I'm going to do that today.

00:02:17.454 --> 00:02:18.287
So I think today in my home,

00:02:18.287 --> 00:02:21.400
So I think today in my home,

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.867
I'm going to force my poor husband

00:02:23.867 --> 00:02:27.100
to help me with the photo
shoot with all these,

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.950
and then I'm going to throw 'em away.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.600
Unless you guys want them

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:33.903
'cause I don't.

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:36.693
First place.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:41.260
Watson-Lancer Speech Tournament.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.120
First place in duo.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.423
Oh my god, there's just so many!

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:47.573
Third place.

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:53.590
This one's small.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:55.230
I don't even know what this is.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.473
There's no plaque on it.

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.300
Anyway so, I'm gonna take a

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:02.450
I'm gonna do a photo shoot today.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.210
Maybe put on a dress

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:07.533
and some makeup for the first
time in a really long time.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:10.923
And yeah.

00:03:10.923 --> 00:03:14.350
We're just gonna say goodbye
to all these trophies today.

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:18.707
And then, I'm probably
gonna go to sleep at like 9?

00:03:18.707 --> 00:03:19.799
And wake up at noon?

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:21.623
And wake up at noon?

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:25.790
'Cause that's what I've been doing

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:28.143
for like a week.

00:03:30.986 --> 00:03:31.819
Alright.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:37.963
I think

00:03:42.001 --> 00:03:42.953
I think that's it.

